        "Content": "Welcome to No. 09 The Green, Abbey Meadows, a beautifully finished three-bedroom mid-terrace home in this growing new neighbourhood in Ferrybank.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living and finished to a high standard, No. 09 offers buyers the opportunity to purchase a brand-new A-Rated home that is turnkey and ready to move into.\r\n\r\nWith flooring, a fitted kitchen, selected fitted wardrobes and all electrical appliances included, many of the additional costs normally associated with moving into a new home have already been taken care of.\r\n\r\nThe home offers a bright, contemporary interior with a layout designed around everyday life. The fitted kitchen provides a stylish and practical heart to the home, while the inclusion of electrical appliances, flooring and selected wardrobes means there is considerably less to organise before moving in.\r\n\r\nAs a brand-new A-Rated home, No. 09 has been designed with energy efficiency and comfort in mind, offering buyers the benefits of a modern new build alongside potentially lower energy demands than many older properties.\r\n\r\nFor eligible first-time buyers, purchasing a qualifying new home may also provide access to supports such as Help to Buy and the First Home Scheme, subject to individual eligibility and scheme criteria.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Green, Abbey Meadows is a thoughtfully planned neighbourhood in Ferrybank, combining modern homes with excellent access to everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nLocal schools, shops, cafés and services are all within easy reach, while Waterford City, the Outer Ring Road and University Hospital Waterford are readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe upcoming Waterford–New Ross Greenway is also close by, adding another fantastic amenity to this growing area.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re taking your first step onto the property ladder, looking for a modern low-maintenance home or simply want the convenience of a new property where much of the finishing work has already been completed, No. 09 The Green is well worth viewing.\r\n\r\nArrange Your Viewing\r\n\r\nContact Liberty Blue Estate Agents on 051 858182 to arrange your viewing or to find out more about\r\n\r\nImportant Information / Disclaimer\r\n\r\nPlease note: Photographs, videos and other marketing imagery used in this advertisement may be of the showhouse at The Green, Abbey Meadows and are for illustrative purposes only. The showhouse contains upgraded finishes, fixtures, fittings, décor and landscaping which do not form part of the standard specification of No. 09.\r\n\r\nIn particular, finishes shown in showhouse imagery may include upgraded kitchen finishes, quartz worktops and splashbacks, landscaped gardens, upgraded décor, furniture, soft furnishings and other additional items which are not included with No. 09.\r\n\r\nNo. 09 includes a fitted kitchen, flooring, electrical kitchen appliances and fitted wardrobes to the master bedroom and second double bedroom. Quartz worktops and showhouse-style landscaping are not included. Purchasers must rely solely on the contract documentation and agreed specification when determining what is included in the sale.\r\n\r\nAny information provided regarding Help to Buy, the First Home Scheme, green mortgage rates, deposit requirements or indicative mortgage repayments is for general guidance only and does not constitute financial advice. Eligibility is subject to individual circumstances, lender criteria and applicable scheme terms and conditions. Prospective purchasers should seek independent financial advice.\r\n\r\nProperty particulars have been prepared by Liberty Blue Estate Agents in conjunction with the developer for information purposes only. Whilst every care has been taken, no responsibility is accepted for inaccuracies or omissions. These particulars do not form part of any offer or contract.\r\n\r\nSubject to contract / contract denied. Specifications, availability and completion timelines are subject to change without notice. All measurements are approximate. Interested parties are advised to satisfy themselves as to the exact specification, condition and working order of any services, fixtures, fittings and appliances. Neither Liberty Blue Estate Agents nor the developer gives any warranty or representation whatsoever in relation to the property."
